  "prefLabel": "Cor 101.27 Residents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 101.27 “Residents” means persons under departmental control and patients of the secure psychiatric unit who are housed in confinement or treatment facilities, and probationers and parolees who are under supervision in community facilities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #7446, eff 2-6-01; ss by #12500, eff 3-23-18 (formerly Cor 101.25) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100)",
